flowchart LR
    classDef domain fill:#e8f0ff,stroke:#2f5bd1,color:#222;
    classDef db fill:#f5ebff,stroke:#7c49c9,color:#222;
    classDef fs fill:#e9f8ef,stroke:#2f8f46,color:#222;
    classDef note fill:#f7f7f7,stroke:#666,color:#222;

    QuoteFlow[3D quoting]:::domain
    OrderFlow[Orders and payments]:::domain
    ContentFlow[Shop, media, QR, and custom requests]:::domain

    QuoteDb[(Quote DB<br/>quote_sessions, quote_line_items)]:::db
    OrderDb[(Order DB<br/>orders, order_items, payments, customers)]:::db
    ContentDb[(Content DB<br/>shop, media, qr, custom requests)]:::db

    QuoteFs[(storage_quotes<br/>uploaded models and previews)]:::fs
    OrderFs[(storage_orders<br/>final files and documents)]:::fs
    ContentFs[(storage_shop + storage_media + storage_requests<br/>shop models, media assets, attachments)]:::fs

    QuoteFlow --> QuoteDb
    QuoteFlow --> QuoteFs

    OrderFlow --> OrderDb
    OrderFlow --> OrderFs

    ContentFlow --> ContentDb
    ContentFlow --> ContentFs

    Note1[Project rule:<br/>the database stores metadata and state;<br/>the storage_* folders store the actual files.]:::note
    Note1 -.-> QuoteDb
    Note1 -.-> QuoteFs
